# LLM Code Evaluation Harness

A Python evaluation harness for testing AI-generated code against benchmark tasks, unit tests, execution timeouts, and structured scoring reports.

This project demonstrates practical AI evaluation infrastructure, including benchmark loading, code execution, test validation, pass/fail scoring, and report generation.

More details will be added as the project develops.
